<a id="1cbeda9b0fe180ee8e52c7911cdcaf21"></a>

<strong>한 칸씩 이동 ⇒ </strong><strong><code>O(n)</code></strong>

![](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/gyungsubLee/subdev-blog-content/357e00e80429348449bcba14b5ab36c813c9d247/posts/1c3eda9b-0fe1-81dd-8ca1-fb4b6e51cb9d/05ef386bd3a48b08.webp)

<a id="1cbeda9b0fe1802d8a75fa548558b300"></a>

<strong>메모리 고속 복사 </strong>

![](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/gyungsubLee/subdev-blog-content/357e00e80429348449bcba14b5ab36c813c9d247/posts/1c3eda9b-0fe1-81dd-8ca1-fb4b6e51cb9d/e5a3049a3e884d5a.webp)

